Jars put in this directory are used in preference to Maven Central, so that
Orchid can be built offline (where the Gradle repositories cannot be reached).
Name them <artifact>-<version>.jar, with the versions in build.gradle.

The library itself has no dependencies.  The tests need:

  junit-4.13.2.jar, hamcrest-core-1.3.jar
  easymock-5.4.0.jar, objenesis-3.4.jar

the demo programs (src/demo):

  commons-io-2.18.0.jar, jsoup-1.18.3.jar

and the optional XML-RPC transport (src/xmlrpc):

  xmlrpc-common-3.1.3.jar, xmlrpc-client-3.1.3.jar, ws-commons-util-1.0.2.jar

flatDir repositories do not resolve transitive dependencies, which is why
the dependencies of these jars are listed too.
